# Public-source data boundary. The repository contains only the deterministic
# knowledge manifest and the documentation/schema for controlled reference data.
# Real reference media, manifests, test packs, reviews, and calibration outputs
# must live under ignored runtime storage or an approved external mount.
data/*
!data/knowledge_manifest.json
!data/reference_library/
data/reference_library/*
!data/reference_library/README.md
!data/reference_library/manifest.schema.json
!data/reference_library/evaluation-manifest.schema.json

